+    /** 标准 Android 电池优化白名单弹窗：多数机型（包括大部分 vivo）都认，点一下就是系统级授权确认框 */
+    private void requestIgnoreBatteryOptimizations() {
+        try {
+            PowerManager pm = (PowerManager) getSystemService(POWER_SERVICE);
+            String pkg = getPackageName();
+            if (pm != null && pm.isIgnoringBatteryOptimizations(pkg)) {
+                Toast.makeText(this, "已经在电池优化白名单里了，不用重复设置", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show();
+                return;
+            }
+            Intent intent = new Intent(Settings.ACTION_REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS);
+            intent.setData(Uri.parse("package:" + pkg));
+            startActivity(intent);
+        } catch (Exception e) {
+            // 部分定制系统屏蔽了这个标准 Intent，退到系统电池设置页让用户自己找
+            try {
+                startActivity(new Intent(Settings.ACTION_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATION_SETTINGS));
+            } catch (Exception e2) {
+                Toast.makeText(this, "无法打开电池优化设置: " + e2.getMessage(), Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show();
+            }
+        }
+    }
+
+    /**
+     * vivo/iQOO OriginOS 的"后台高耗电"权限页是厂商私有页面，没有标准 Android API，
+     * 只能按已知的组件名尝试跳转，不同系统版本入口可能不一样，所以做了一串按顺序尝试的候选列表，
+     * 全部失败就退到本应用的系统详情页，让用户自己在里面找权限管理入口。
+     */
+    private void openVivoBackgroundPermission() {
+        String[][] candidates = {
+                {"com.vivo.permissionmanager", "com.vivo.permissionmanager.activity.BgStartUpManagerActivity"},
+                {"com.vivo.permissionmanager", "com.vivo.permissionmanager.activity.PurviewTabActivity"},
+                {"com.iqoo.secure", "com.iqoo.secure.ui.phoneoptimize.AddWhiteListActivity"},
+                {"com.iqoo.secure", "com.iqoo.secure.ui.phoneoptimize.BgStartUpManagerActivity"},
+                {"com.vivo.abe", "com.vivo.applicationbook.ui.BatteryOptimizeManagerActivity"},
+        };
+        for (String[] c : candidates) {
+            try {
+                Intent intent = new Intent();
+                intent.setClassName(c[0], c[1]);
+                intent.setFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK);
+                startActivity(intent);
+                return;
+            } catch (Exception ignored) {
+                // 这个候选在当前系统上不存在，试下一个
+            }
+        }
+        // 都不行，退到应用详情页，用户自己在里面找"权限"或"自启动"相关入口
+        try {
+            Intent intent = new Intent(Settings.ACTION_APPLICATION_DETAILS_SETTINGS);
+            intent.setData(Uri.parse("package:" + getPackageName()));
+            startActivity(intent);
+            Toast.makeText(this, "没找到专用入口，已跳转到应用详情页，自己找一下权限管理", Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show();
+        } catch (Exception e) {
+            Toast.makeText(this, "跳转失败: " + e.getMessage(), Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show();
+        }
+    }
